# Files Wrangler does not upload as static assets (same syntax as .gitignore).
# Do not list _redirects or _headers here: Wrangler reads them from this folder,
# and ignoring them would switch off the redirect and header rules.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
**/Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
